{
  "spec": {
    "template": {
      "spec": {
        "volumes": [
          {
            "name": "log-volume",
            "emptyDir": {}
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "name": "app",
            "volumeMounts": [
              {
                "name": "log-volume",
                "mountPath": "/var/log"
              },
              {
                "name": "log-volume",
                "mountPath": "/var/run"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}'
```
This looks like a comprehensive patch to allow writing to common directories while maintaining `readOnlyRootFilesystem: true`.

I will execute the patch command.

